{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an image-only model using ResNet50 encoder without RNA data, aggregation, or fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.208 and F1 of 0.172 are lower than the RNA-only baseline (0.485 accuracy, 0.464 F1), suggesting image modality alone may underperform. The role of image features and potential interactions with RNA data remains uncertain without direct comparison to multimodal approaches."
}

